body:
Not sure we want to change the `facetName` behavior, it's more complex to use with an object because you can pass whatever you want.

I think what you want is the ability to add more data to the underlying templates, so maybe we could just do something like:

``` js
for facet in facets:
  myWidget({
    facetName: facet.name,
    templatesData: facet,
    templates: {
      header: headerTemplate
  });
```

or 

``` js
for facet in facets:
  myWidget({
    facetName: facet.name,
    templates: {
      header: prepare(headerTemplate, facet) //  replace(/FACET_TITLE/g, facet.title) or something
  });
```

What do you think?
